From 1460c200ab0d0d0d887d928bfc0d5f6f0bef6a92 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 05:30:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] kanban: capsule worker-context rewrite locates the Workspace
 header by structure, fails closed [daveey]

Pinned review P1/P2: the capsule rewrite searched the rendered context for the header, so a title holding
'## Body' or a forged 'Workspace:' line could shadow it and leave the host path in the prompt. The owner now
computes the header line's exact span from _ctx_header's line list (ctx_workspace_span) and the rewrite
replaces only that span; a missing or non-matching span raises capsule_context_header_drift.
---
